Subject: Adapt original page-control scalar callback contexts for native compilers

Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

The original producer encodes only button index zero or one in void*.
Native pointer-width casts carry that scalar value without changing unsigned
source indices, handlers, branch order, allocation or ownership. Wii source
projection is identical. No callback or control behavior is replaced.

diff --git a/src/Game/FE/fePageControls.cpp b/src/Game/FE/fePageControls.cpp
--- a/src/Game/FE/fePageControls.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/FE/fePageControls.cpp
